 "case:locations.below.description": "Behind the green baize door are the kitchens. The back stairs come down into them from the first floor, and the cellar stairs go on down to the cellar and the plant room. The back door opens onto a courtyard deep in snow, with the staff cottage across it and the car park beyond, by the gate.",
 "case:locations.below.hotspots.hs_bs_car.label": "The car park",
 "case:locations.below.hotspots.hs_bs_car.text": "Every car is under a foot of snow except one: Rory Lisle’s red sports car by the gatepost, with only a few inches on its bonnet. Somebody ran its engine for a long while last night, and the snow kept falling after. By the gatepost, your phone finds one bar of signal; a step away, it’s gone.",
 "case:locations.below.hotspots.hs_bs_cottage.label": "The staff cottage",
 "case:locations.below.hotspots.hs_bs_cottage.text": "A low whitewashed cottage across the yard, with a holly bush by the door.",
 "case:locations.below.hotspots.hs_bs_kitchen.label": "The kitchens",
 "case:locations.below.hotspots.hs_bs_kitchen.text": "The chef says every clock in here was blinking 00:00 this morning, the ovens, the microwave and the dishwasher, until he set them again at six. At midnight the kitchens were empty: ‘We were all in the hall for the last dance and the photo.’ The back stairs come down at one end; the cellar stairs go down from the passage at the other.",
 "case:locations.below.hotspots.hs_bs_plant.label": "The plant room",
 "case:locations.below.hotspots.hs_bs_plant.text": "Down the cellar stairs and along a whitewashed passage is a warm room that hums with the boiler. Hamish shows you the switch, and you time the walk back to each part of the hotel.",
 "case:locations.below.name": "Below stairs",
 "case:locations.below.summary": "The kitchens, the plant room, the staff cottage across the yard, and the car park.",
