 "case:locations.first.art.props.8.label": "Main stairs",
 "case:locations.first.description": "The Glenmorran’s best corridor: tartan carpet, stags’ heads, and bedrooms named for Highland plants and beasts. The Victoria Suite, Miss Rennie’s room and the linen room are at the west end, by the back stairs down to the kitchens. The main stairs come up in the middle, and the Stag Room is at the east end. Mrs K’s trolley stands where she left it, outside the linen room.",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_linen.label": "The linen room",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_linen.text": "A narrow room of slatted shelves, warm from the hot-water pipes and smelling of starch. Mr Munro unlocks it for you. Kasia found her mother on the floor by the far shelves; her big rubber torch lies where it rolled. On the near shelf, clean pillowcases are half put away; the rest are still in their basket on the floor. You go through every shelf and the basket: no chain, and no stone.",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_peggy.label": "Miss Rennie’s room",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_peggy.text": "Only Miss Rennie could have reached the switch, so you ask to see her room. She opens the door for you without a word, and waits in the corridor.",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_stag.label": "The Stag Room",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_stag.text": "Rory Lisle’s room, at the east end of the corridor.",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_stairs.label": "The top of the main stairs",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_stairs.text": "Now that you know the darkness was made, you look at the ways somebody could have come up to this floor in it.",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_suite.label": "The Victoria Suite",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_suite.text": "Dame Vivienne’s suite: a sitting room full of hothouse flowers, and a bedroom with a four-poster, where she slept last night with Mrs K’s hot water bottle at her feet. A connecting door leads through to a smaller room, Miss Rennie’s. It’s shut.",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_trolley.label": "Mrs K’s trolley",
 "case:locations.first.hotspots.hs_fl_trolley.text": "Fresh towels, a stack of shortbread rounds in waxed paper, a basket of hot water bottles, and her clipboard.",
 "case:locations.first.name": "The first floor",
 "case:locations.first.summary": "The Victoria Suite, the linen room, Mrs K’s trolley, the Stag Room and the main stairs.",
 "case:locations.hall.art.props.0.label": "Great Hall",
