 "case:timeline.conclusion": "At 23:15 Dame Vivienne gave the Black Ice away. At 23:45 Mr Munro went up to beg for it, and at 23:52, from his car by the gatepost, Rory began begging his bookmaker. At 23:57 the band took its photo, and a minute later the lights went out: not the storm, but the hotel’s own main switch, three minutes’ walk from the Great Hall. At five past twelve Tomasz climbed the main stairs with a red candle, calling for Mrs K. She didn’t answer. At 00:24 Hamish pushed the switch back up, and at 06:40 Kasia found her mother.",
